<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 338.10 mln rand SAfrican bonds Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 338.10 mln rand SAfrican bonds Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 338.10 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Friday after selling 821.54 million rand's worth on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
